  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wastewater Works in Koura Caza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The contract is to execute the following works: -Construction of a wastewater conveyor of about 5.08 km along Ouadi Hab. -Construction of a wastewater conveyor of about 1.09 km from Ouadi Hab to the first shaft of the under construction Tripoli Microtunnel. -Construction of wastewater lines of about 3.3 km from Qalamoun to Bahsass. -Construction of a wastewater conveyor of about 1.34 km in Ouadi to Abou Halqa. -Construction of a wastewater conveyor of about 4.1 km in Ouadi Ras Masqa. -Construction of a wastewater conveyor of about 4.26 km in Ouadi En Nakhleh. -Construction of wastewater lines of about 2.35 km in Batroumine including lateral sewers. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
